       ] ;
       fhir:name [ fhir:v "Patient Gender Extension" ] ;
       fhir:description [ fhir:v "To map and write gender codes defined by the Saudi-Health-Data-Dictionary-v2.pdf. There are additional codes than just male and female defined by this specification. Use this extension along with Patient.gender element. Saudi-Health-Data-Dictionary-v2.pdf includes a data element for Sex, intended to support the exchange of a recorded sex value. This extension aligns with this definition of Sex: This field contains a code which defines the sex of the patient. It enables systems to share the sex value as it was documented in a particular context." ] ;
